{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/issues/comments/6405344560","html_url":"https://github.com/fum-lab/fum/issues/378#issuecomment-6405344560","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/issues/378","id":6405344560,"node_id":"IC_kwDOTKYpjM8AAAABfcnNMA","user":{"login":"Roman-Kerimov","id":22149544,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTQ5NTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22149544?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov","html_url":"https://github.com/Roman-Kerimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Roman-Kerimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-26T00:13:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T00:14:23Z","author_association":"MEMBER","body":"**FUM Codex**\n\nСохранён следующий проверенный checkpoint RAW-архива: [`cfd73bb` — «Остановить запуск при дрейфе бинарника и связать профиль»](https://github.com/fum-lab/fum/commit/cfd73bbe1efc682fac4cec1220b9d9f4ab6caa6a). Исправлен тестовый барьер дрейфа бинарника до запуска Process; положительный сценарий 264 МиБ и ссылка RSS сохранены. Непосредственный координатор независимо сверил предметную дельту; ROOT ещё не принял поставку.\n\nТекущая задержка — перенос девяти новых имён в вычисленный lowercase ASCII kebab-case. Старый plan/apply делает глобальный Markdown-проход для каждого файла; одного read-only plan потребовалось около пяти минут. Последующие повторы остановлены до применения. Направление имён взяло конечный пакетный Swift-перенос; ручная серия git mv, изменение Python и ослабление проверок не используются.\n\nПробел передачи политики сохранён отдельно в [№380](https://github.com/fum-lab/fum/issues/380). Историческая карта и актуальный снимок после исправления теста различаются и сохраняются отдельно. После переноса остаются точное ревью, PR и приёмка. Полный импорт рабочего JSONL и связь архива с графом FUMA пока не выполнены.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fum-lab/fum/issues/comments/6405344560/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at